        <headline>special marine warning in effect</headline>
        <description>
Periods of freezing rain will continue this morning.

Freezing rain is expected to taper off somewhat this afternoon, but there is still a risk of patchy freezing rain until Sunday.

###

Surfaces of vessels may become icy and slippery.

Please continue to monitor alerts and forecasts issued by Environment Canada. For more information monitor Canadian Coast Guard radio or Weatheradio stations.
</description>
